<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" version="2.0"><channel><atom:link href="https://www.aboutamazon.com/rss/feed.rss" type="application/rss+xml" rel="self"/><title>Amazon News</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/amazon-news-today</link><description>Amazon News RSS Feed</description><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 01:02:49 GMT</lastBuildDate><image><title>Amazon News</title><url>https://assets.aboutamazon.com/f2/a4/a07ef04d49df8b93eb283512a0fc/amazon-news-newsletter-beige.png</url><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/amazon-news-today</link></image><item><title>Amazon in the community: Here’s what’s happening in Seattle, Bellevue, and the Puget Sound</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-seattle-bellevue-puget-sound-news?utm_source=rss</link><description>Learn how we invest in the community, help power the local economy, and support our employees in the Puget Sound region.</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 22:05:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-seattle-bellevue-puget-sound-news</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/fa71e99/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1125x1125+438+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Ff2%2Fe4%2F6f67188e480392ce0b19a6671b59%2Fspheres-rolling-blog-hero-1.jpg"/></item><item><title>&apos;Clarkson&apos;s Farm&apos; special &apos;Jeremy Grows a Car&apos; coming to Prime Video in 2027</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/clarksons-farm-special-jeremy-grows-a-car-prime-video?utm_source=rss</link><description>Jeremy Clarkson is going back to his automotive roots by building his own car using produce from his farm.</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 18:00:06 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/clarksons-farm-special-jeremy-grows-a-car-prime-video</guid><category>Entertainment</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/425729f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Ffc%2F0b%2Fd8dbddfe4281af1346b1235b1d65%2Fjeremy-grows-a-car-clarkson-farm-special-hero-amazon-news.png"/></item><item><title>Ring ends smart lock anxiety with a lock you can recharge by hand</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/ring-smart-lock-battery-recharge?utm_source=rss</link><description> Ring&apos;s first-ever smart lock eliminates the need for a key with a built-in power dial and four ways in.</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 13:55:11 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/ring-smart-lock-battery-recharge</guid><category>Devices</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/9be1cab/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1126+0+0/resize/767x432!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F04%2Fe8%2F467af05c4b43accf78a07e26553a%2Fring-smart-lock-hero-amazonnews-ck10626.jpg"/></item><item><title>Ring introduces four new 4K cameras and a pan-tilt indoor cam</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/ring-4k-cameras-pan-tilt-cam?utm_source=rss</link><description>Ring’s expanded camera lineup gives you more ways to see and protect your home, indoors and out.</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 13:55:09 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/ring-4k-cameras-pan-tilt-cam</guid><category>Devices</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/053e82f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1126+0+0/resize/767x432!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fda%2F01%2F499bedff40f989fc37e1cece41ad%2Ffreya-pr-ring-family-1-2000x1126.jpg"/></item><item><title>Prime Big Deal Days 2026 ends tonight: 200 of the best deals to shop now</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/retail/best-prime-big-deal-days-2026-top-deals?utm_source=rss</link><description>Prime Big Deal Days ends tonight at 11:59 p.m. PDT (2:59 a.m. EDT Thursday). From tech and toys to kitchen, beauty, and fall fashion, here are the top deals to shop before the 48-hour event ends.</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 12:38:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/retail/best-prime-big-deal-days-2026-top-deals</guid><category>Retail</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/bd8ee6c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fdd%2Fa8%2Fb5a8909247d3a271b88551721627%2Fpbdd-2026-best-deals-hero5-amazon-news-lt.gif"/></item><item><title>Amazon data center communities: Here’s what’s happening near data centers across the US</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/aws/amazon-data-centers-locations-news?utm_source=rss</link><description>Get the latest updates on how Amazon supports small businesses, creates jobs, sets up sustainability initiatives, and develops educational programs near AWS data centers.</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 18:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/aws/amazon-data-centers-locations-news</guid><category>AWS</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/6081627/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2962x2962+1155+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fa3%2Ff6%2F0abb1c1a4734ba2e727893e6eae2%2Faws-data-center-exterior-1.jpg"/></item><item><title>5 ways Amazon is investing in Massachusetts</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-massachusetts-jobs-infrastructure-small-business?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon&apos;s investments are boosting the Bay State&apos;s economy while creating opportunities for those who call Massachusetts home. </description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 15:58:11 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-massachusetts-jobs-infrastructure-small-business</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/2061e55/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F63%2Fcb%2Fe41ecc5b42449c262d7837a05812%2Fabout-amazon-hero-boston-adobestock-213946896.jpg"/></item><item><title>5 ways Amazon is investing in Missouri</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-missouri-jobs-infrastructure-small-business?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon&apos;s investments are boosting Missouri’s economy while creating opportunities for Missourians. </description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 15:56:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-missouri-jobs-infrastructure-small-business</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/5051b01/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fe7%2F1b%2F55189ef04ea69c1432bd64b3a8b0%2Fabout-amazon-hero-hannibal-adobestock-680684590.jpg"/></item><item><title>Prime Video and the Television Academy announce 6-year deal to exclusively stream the Emmy Awards globally</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/prime-video-emmy-awards-deal?utm_source=rss</link><description>Beginning in 2027, the Emmy Awards will stream live and free on Prime Video in more than 240 countries and territories—the first time the ceremony has had a single, dedicated home.</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 12:58:12 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/prime-video-emmy-awards-deal</guid><category>Entertainment</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/a09aaa3/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F6b%2F3a%2F0dfc8995438a941ee165f65bb8e6%2Fprimevideo-emmys-streaming-amazonnews-cdlt-10-5-2026.png"/></item><item><title>5 ways Amazon is investing in Connecticut</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-connecticut-jobs-infrastructure-small-business?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon&apos;s investments are boosting the Constitution State&apos;s economy while creating opportunities for Connecticut residents. </description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 16:44:55 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-connecticut-jobs-infrastructure-small-business</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/4ec094a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fe1%2F08%2Fa2588bcb41629279981998e84117%2Fabout-amazon-hero-new-haven-adobestock-475790017.jpg"/></item></channel></rss>